  "notes": "## 0.11.1 - 2026-05-24\n\n### Features\n\n- Show cumulative release notes in the update dialog when upgrading across skipped versions, capped to the most recent 5 versions (#836)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix startup failures on Linux KDE/KWallet systems that could leave the app unable to resume a saved session (#841)\n- Show clearer guidance for used, expired, or rejected invitation codes and ask users to enter a new code instead of retrying the same one (#837)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.11.1 - 2026-05-24\n\n### Features\n\n- 跨多个版本升级时，更新对话框会展示累计发布说明，最多包含最近 5 个版本 (#836)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Linux KDE/KWallet 环境下应用可能无法启动并恢复已保存会话的问题 (#841)\n- 邀请码已使用、过期或被拒绝时显示更清楚的提示，并引导用户重新输入新的邀请码 (#837)",
